Polyimide materials offer opportunities in gas-separation membranes and selected specialized technical applications. Their chemical and thermal properties can support applications that require durability and stable performance under demanding conditions.

Research into flexible sensors, biomedical devices and advanced industrial membranes may create further opportunities, subject to application-specific qualification and performance requirements.

